desc: MIDI Note Convert
author: José M Muñoz (J-WalkMan)
version: 0.9
changelog: Initial release
metapackage: true
provides:
  josmmuozjwalkman_MIDI Note Convert/MIDI Note to CC.jsfx > josmmuozjwalkman_MIDI Note Convert/JWM_MIDI Note to CC
  josmmuozjwalkman_MIDI Note Convert/MIDI Note to PC.jsfx > josmmuozjwalkman_MIDI Note Convert/JWM_Midi Note to PC
  josmmuozjwalkman_MIDI Note Convert/MIDI Note Trigger CC > josmmuozjwalkman_MIDI Note Convert/JWM_MIDI Note Trigger CC
about:
  #MIDI Note Convert

  These JSFX Plugins turn MIDI note messages to other types of messages like CC or PC

